<title>USA: Canisco Resources Q3 Dec 31 net slips. [CORRECTED 16:46 GMT]</title>
<headline>Canisco Resources Q3 Dec 31 net slips. [CORRECTED 16:46 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canisco Resources Inc</p>
<p>			  Three Months Ended    Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>		     12-31-96    12-31-95    12-31-96     12-31-95</p>
<p>   (Company corrects last column date from 9-30-95 to 12-31-95)</p>
<p> Revenues     $13,249,980 $21,056,009 $40,018,812 $67,054,175</p>
<p>Income from continuing operations</p>
<p>			128,094     314,345     692,666     992,243</p>
<p> Net earnings     121,551     171,164     643,722     106,381</p>
<p> Earnings per share  0.06	  0.08	  0.30	  0.05</p>
<p>NOTE: Company said reduction of revenues compared to the prior year is due primarily to the sale of the staff augmentation business of the Company's NSS Numanco subsidiary.</p>
